{"id":"oce_an","lemma":"océan","pos":"noun","rank":1661,"glosses":["an ocean (one of the large bodies of water separating the continents)","the ocean (the continuous body of salt water covering a majority of the Earth's surface)","ocean (immense expanse; any vast space or quantity without apparent limit)"],"ipa":"/ɔ.se.ɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/42/Fr-oc%C3%A9an.ogg/Fr-oc%C3%A9an.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"océans"},"formAudio":{"océans":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-oc%C3%A9ans.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"L'océan était calme.","en":"The ocean was calm.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/38038","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"calm"}]},{"text":"Le monde a cinq océans.","en":"The world has five oceans.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"world"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"five"},null]},{"text":"Je veux aussi voir l'océan.","en":"I also want to see the ocean.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"too, also, as well"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"J'aime l'océan.","en":"I like the ocean.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"aimer"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Vous pouvez sentir l'océan d'ici.","en":"You can smell the ocean from here.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to smell"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"here"}]}]}